{"id":"ac13d054390a6b63","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-many-one.md","title":"多一归约与一一归约","display":"df-many-one — 多一归约与一一归约","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-many-one","aliases":["43-df-many-one"],"display":"df-many-one — 多一归约与一一归约","depends_on":["[[43-df-computable]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"Definition 5.4.2, print p.15 / PDF p.35","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"definition-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-many-one"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-many-one</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-many-one — 多一归约与一一归约"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Definition 5.4.2, print p.15 / PDF p.35"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；所量化 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 均为总函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\le_mB\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\ (\\operatorname{Computable}(f)\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\le_mB\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\ (\\operatorname{Computable}(f)\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\le_1B\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\ (\\operatorname{Computable}(f)\\land\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb N\\;(f(x)=f(y)\\Rightarrow x=y)\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\le_1B\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\ (\\operatorname{Computable}(f)\\land\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb N\\;(f(x)=f(y)\\Rightarrow x=y)\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>不删除空集和全集等边界情形；定义本身对它们有意义。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 5.4.2, print p.15 / PDF p.35。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"A\\le_mB\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\ (\\operatorname{Computable}(f)\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in B)).","display":true},{"tex":"A\\le_1B\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\ (\\operatorname{Computable}(f)\\land\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb N\\;(f(x)=f(y)\\Rightarrow x=y)\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in B)).","display":true}],"bytes":1143,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-25","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-many-one]] — 多一归约与一一归约"},{"id":"dfe1795841d4879a","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M_{K_V},N_Q$ 见 [[43-df-nonrandom-complexity-graphs]]；$V,U:2^{<\\omega}\\rightharpoonup2^{<\\omega}$；$\\operatorname{UniversalPF}$ 见 [[43-df-universal-prefix-machine]]。$\\operatorname{CE},\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}},\\le_m,\\varnothing'$ 见 [[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-tt]]、[[43-df-many-one]]、[[43-df-jump]]。$Q$ 只取本目录已定义的普通与前缀条件复杂度。"},{"id":"e4f81d62107f6eeb","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$；Σ、Π、Δ见 [[43-df-sigman]]，CE^B见 [[43-df-ce]]。$\\le_m$见 [[43-df-many-one]]。"},{"id":"b7e62f31e9a6d8a9","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$R\\in2^\\omega$；$\\operatorname{AsSequence}$ 见 [[43-df-infseq]]。$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$、$\\le_K,\\le_C$、$\\le_m$ 分别见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-complexity-red]]、[[43-df-many-one]]。"},{"id":"18deece8246467ad","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\le_1,\\le_m$ 采用 [[43-df-many-one]]；$\\le_{\\rm tt}$、$\\le_{\\rm wtt}$、$\\le_T$ 分别采用 [[43-df-tt]]、[[43-df-wtt]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。"}],"outgoing":["f357216a7edb035a"]}